-- 100 spell_dbc rows for the '+3% to all stats' bonus per 50 elite/rare
-- kills (rank ELITE/RAREELITE/RARE — not normal, and not boss/WORLDBOSS,
-- which has its own line 901000-901099) — kill_milestones.cpp,
-- GrantEliteTierIfReached. Same approach as kt_boss_bonus_spells.sql: one
-- SPELL_AURA_MOD_TOTAL_STAT_PERCENTAGE (137) effect, EffectMiscValue=-1
-- (all 5 stats), EffectBasePoints=3, Attributes=64 = SPELL_ATTR0_PASSIVE.
-- The player accumulates one per 50 elite/rare kills — max 100 tiers
-- (5000 kills) = +300% to stats.
